4. CORE COMMERCIAL MODEL

4.1 Basic listing can be free

Builders/developers should be able to create a basic project/property presence without an upfront listing barrier, subject to verification, quality and market rules.

Free/basic layer can include:

project/property profile

location

configurations

amenities

approved media

structured project information

availability/status

basic enquiry capability

4.2 Transaction creates commercial value

The commercial proposition to a builder can be:

List your project on HOMIO. Basic presence can be free. If a HOMIO-originated opportunity results in a transaction, the applicable pre-agreed commercial/commission/closure terms apply.

This must be contractually clear and jurisdiction-specific.

Strategic objective

Lower builder acquisition friction while protecting HOMIO's transaction economics.

